1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
"Tamed"

2
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:36,000
(Episode 4: Taking Care of the Master)

3
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:52,040
Cheng.

4
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:52,879
Cheng Yu'an.

5
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,040
Wake up.

6
00:01:56,819 --> 00:01:58,040
Why did you drink so much?

7
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:55,560
Put this on.

8
00:02:55,740 --> 00:02:56,740
It's cold outside.

9
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:04,020
How come you're free today, Dr. Shen?

10
00:03:05,419 --> 00:03:07,080
No need to report back to my dad?

11
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,800
I have Wednesdays off.

12
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,639
Spying on me on your day off?

13
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,439
Or is this a medical visit?

14
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:24,639
Shen Mo.

15
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:26,500
Look at me.

16
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:29,159
You're my brother's therapist, right?

17
00:03:29,419 --> 00:03:31,159
Dad told you to watch him, right?

18
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:33,919
And why are you watching me?

19
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:35,680
Did Dad tell you to watch me,

20
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,400
or...

21
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,240
did you want to come yourself?

22
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,080
Cheng Yuze.

23
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,120
Don't use my full name.

24
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,800
Shen Mo.

25
00:03:49,099 --> 00:03:50,599
Whose doctor are you, really?

26
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:51,879
Whose spy are you?

27
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,400
What are you to who?

28
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:00,719
Shen Mo.

29
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,080
You've had too much.

30
00:04:03,139 --> 00:04:04,300
You're not thinking straight.

31
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,680
I am.

32
00:04:09,819 --> 00:04:11,699
Are you serious?

33
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,680
Done asking?

34
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,560
Not yet.

35
00:04:49,796 --> 00:04:50,488
(Day 1095, almost there.
After completing the final

36
00:04:50,512 --> 00:04:51,204
verification and organization
of evidence, clarifying

37
00:04:51,228 --> 00:04:51,866
the flow of funds and
proof of illegality of all

38
00:04:51,890 --> 00:04:52,636
involved parties, the case
has entered its final stage.)

39
00:05:14,323 --> 00:05:16,203
[Mo, when you get back, let's try
the new ramen place. Brother's treat]

40
00:05:16,259 --> 00:05:17,259
Mo.

41
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,220
The world owes my parents and me justice.

42
00:05:19,319 --> 00:05:20,680
Live a good life for us.

43
00:05:21,220 --> 00:05:22,220
Keep a close eye on him.

44
00:05:22,779 --> 00:05:24,059
Don't let him out of your sight.

45
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:26,120
Especially those around him.

46
00:05:59,660 --> 00:06:00,660
Shen Mo.

47
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,720
You've already made your decision.

48
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,640
So keep your feelings out of it.

49
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,779
You shouldn't get involved with Cheng Yuze.

50
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:09,980
Don't forget who you are.

51
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Don't go.

52
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:14,199
What?

53
00:07:16,319 --> 00:07:17,339
Don't go.

54
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:21,560
Don't go.

55
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,240
Don't go.

56
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,680
I won't go.

57
00:08:14,860 --> 00:08:18,980
Are you really unbreakable?

58
00:08:23,939 --> 00:08:24,699
Cheng Yuze.

59
00:08:24,699 --> 00:08:25,980
Your brother's drunk.

60
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:27,579
What really happened?

61
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:29,580
Someone's been causing trouble at the firm.

62
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:31,139
Demanding Uncle Lin's sketches.

63
00:08:31,519 --> 00:08:32,539
But don't worry.

64
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,100
We'll handle it soon.

65
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,500
It's past midnight.

66
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:37,039
It's my brother's birthday today.

67
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,360
I haven't got him a gift yet.

68
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,879
I gotta go for now.

69
00:08:48,139 --> 00:08:49,919
Should I do something?

70
00:09:44,019 --> 00:09:45,500
What does the Pet Code say?

71
00:09:46,379 --> 00:09:48,059
Can we make an exception tonight?

72
00:09:49,139 --> 00:09:51,460
I couldn't sleep, so I was sketching.

73
00:09:52,019 --> 00:09:53,019
Sketching what?

74
00:09:54,299 --> 00:09:55,440
Nothing much.

75
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,860
Just doodling.

76
00:09:57,759 --> 00:09:58,519
Give it to me.

77
00:09:58,740 --> 00:09:59,860
It's really nothing.

78
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:17,340
You're copying your father's painting.

79
00:10:19,379 --> 00:10:20,379
Why?

80
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,480
Now.

81
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:29,980
Go back to your room and sleep.

82
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,120
Right now.

83
00:10:31,659 --> 00:10:32,659
Immediately.

84
00:10:54,259 --> 00:10:55,840
Good night, then.

85
00:11:10,179 --> 00:11:11,440
Cheng Yu'an.

86
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:14,120
What are you doing?

87
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:51,580
Such a disobedient little puppy.

88
00:12:29,059 --> 00:12:30,059
Hello, Cheng Yuze.

89
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,120
Lin Qi.

90
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:32,340
Guess what?

91
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,879
Those guys were easy to fool.

92
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:35,559
Thanks to you.

93
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,600
Otherwise,

94
00:12:36,659 --> 00:12:38,639
they'd still be pestering my brother.

95
00:12:39,576 --> 00:12:40,456
It was nothing much.

96
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,220
Just a painting with a few changes.

97
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:43,139
You're quite the artist.

98
00:12:43,460 --> 00:12:44,460
Don't be so modest.

99
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:45,740
You've done us a huge favor.

100
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:48,139
Think of something to ask my brother for.

101
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,320
Really, there's no need.

102
00:12:50,759 --> 00:12:52,316
Your brother's let me stay all this time.

103
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:54,419
This is the least I can do.

104
00:12:55,139 --> 00:12:56,720
Then tell me,

105
00:12:56,879 --> 00:12:58,199
what have you been wanting to do?

106
00:12:58,379 --> 00:12:59,459
You have to name something.

107
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,059
Come on.

108
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:01,379
Just between us.

109
00:13:01,539 --> 00:13:03,419
Maybe I can share in the perks.

110
00:13:06,159 --> 00:13:09,360
I'd love to see the Private Warmth VIP art exhibition.

111
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:11,539
But you need a VIP invitation.

112
00:13:12,139 --> 00:13:13,139
Forget it.

113
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,620
Just wishful thinking.

114
00:13:15,299 --> 00:13:16,980
Spare me.

115
00:13:17,759 --> 00:13:19,779
I'm really not into paintings.

116
00:13:20,220 --> 00:13:22,059
I finally escaped the Academy of Fine Arts.

117
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,539
Guess I won't get any perks out of this.

118
00:13:24,980 --> 00:13:26,039
Come on!

119
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:27,960
I can only dream about it.

120
00:13:28,419 --> 00:13:29,019
OK.

121
00:13:29,019 --> 00:13:30,419
I've got other things to do.

122
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:31,580
Bye.

123
00:13:35,340 --> 00:13:36,340
By the way, Brother,

124
00:13:36,379 --> 00:13:37,779
Zhou Zhi restored your painting.

125
00:13:38,139 --> 00:13:39,499
I'll bring it over this afternoon.

126
00:13:41,700 --> 00:13:42,860
I'll head out now.

127
00:13:43,179 --> 00:13:44,539
Cover for me with Dad!

128
00:14:00,019 --> 00:14:01,019
Come downstairs.

129
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,000
Wait,

130
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:03,519
wait a second.

131
00:14:03,519 --> 00:14:04,139
I'm not ready.

132
00:14:04,139 --> 00:14:05,139
Now.

133
00:14:16,923 --> 00:14:18,123
[Private Warmth, VIP invitation]

134
00:14:18,659 --> 00:14:19,759
It's nothing, Cheng Yu'an.

135
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:22,419
Just repaying him for looking after me last night.

136
00:14:28,759 --> 00:14:29,759
Get in.

137
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,120
Where will we go?

138
00:14:31,179 --> 00:14:32,539
You'll find out when we get there.

139
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,940
Private Warmth.

140
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:51,720
We're here.

141
00:14:52,679 --> 00:14:53,740
Private Warmth.

142
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:55,220
It really is Private Warmth!

143
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,220
How did you know?

144
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:56,779
Cheng Yu'an.

145
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,840
Thank you.

146
00:15:01,299 --> 00:15:01,799
I'm...

147
00:15:01,799 --> 00:15:02,419
I'm sorry.

148
00:15:02,419 --> 00:15:03,500
I got too excited.

149
00:15:04,019 --> 00:15:05,019
Let's go in.

150
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,279
These two sections

151
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:09,899
feature works in different styles.

152
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:15,100
This way, please.

153
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,279
There are more over there.

154
00:15:22,460 --> 00:15:23,139
Let's look at that one.

155
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,480
OK.

156
00:15:26,279 --> 00:15:27,279
Looks good to me.

157
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:35,100
Look at this piece.

158
00:15:35,580 --> 00:15:37,539
The brushwork conveys a sense of rupture.

159
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:39,519
As if it's saying,

160
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,679
what looks calm on the surface

161
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:44,259
is full of wounds underneath.

162
00:15:51,299 --> 00:15:53,820
I came to this gallery as a child.

163
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:55,840
Twenty years ago,

164
00:15:56,639 --> 00:15:57,879
I took painting lessons here.

165
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:30,340
The driver's waiting downstairs.

166
00:16:32,659 --> 00:16:33,759
I was just looking for something.

167
00:16:33,759 --> 00:16:34,759
I'll leave right now.

168
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:41,899
How many times have I told you?

169
00:16:42,019 --> 00:16:43,779
Painting is a waste of time.

170
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,120
Remember,

171
00:16:47,379 --> 00:16:49,039
the heir to Cheng Group

172
00:16:49,039 --> 00:16:51,200
doesn't need useless things like tears.

173
00:16:51,299 --> 00:16:52,039
Cheng Yu'an.

174
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,320
Remember this:

175
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:55,240
You've never liked painting.

176
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:57,580
Come meet a friend of mine.

177
00:16:58,759 --> 00:17:00,019
His friend?

178
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:02,639
Thank you.

179
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:03,820
Thank you.

180
00:17:05,119 --> 00:17:06,119
This is Lin Qi.

181
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:06,859
Lin Qi.

182
00:17:06,859 --> 00:17:07,420
Yes.

183
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:08,119
Hello.

184
00:17:08,119 --> 00:17:08,839
Hello.

185
00:17:08,839 --> 00:17:09,539
Hello.

186
00:17:09,839 --> 00:17:10,839
Hello.

187
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,960
Stay there few days?

188
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:13,900
Oh, yeah.

189
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:15,180
Three days.

190
00:17:16,099 --> 00:17:17,279
Three days.

191
00:17:17,420 --> 00:17:18,559
Let me think…

192
00:17:21,339 --> 00:17:22,339
This is for you.

193
00:17:22,579 --> 00:17:23,579
Thank you.

194
00:17:23,779 --> 00:17:24,899
You're really enjoying that.

195
00:17:25,019 --> 00:17:26,019
It's delicious.

196
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,440
What are you doing?

197
00:17:35,940 --> 00:17:37,420
You've got something there.

198
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:39,420
What?

199
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:40,640
Don't do that.

200
00:18:22,299 --> 00:18:23,380
I'll take a call outside.

201
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:24,520
It's the flower shop owner.

202
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:29,880
He ran off.

203
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:30,660
That's right.

204
00:18:30,779 --> 00:18:32,440
Brother, won't you go after him?

205
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:33,960
He'll be back.

206
00:18:45,339 --> 00:18:46,700
Say no more. I get it.

207
00:18:47,180 --> 00:18:49,680
No need to explain.

208
00:18:51,019 --> 00:18:52,019
Is the cake good?

209
00:18:53,859 --> 00:18:54,859
Yeah. Thanks, Brother.

210
00:18:55,019 --> 00:18:56,019
You're welcome.

211
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:11,339
See that?

212
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:12,400
Yeah.

213
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:49,160
Have some more.

214
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:49,940
No more, thanks.

215
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:51,119
I won't have any.

216
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,519
Those two look close.

217
00:20:05,819 --> 00:20:06,819
Yeah.

218
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,099
Was it something urgent?

219
00:20:10,619 --> 00:20:11,420
Nothing much.

220
00:20:11,420 --> 00:20:12,780
She'll going to fly back home.

221
00:20:13,220 --> 00:20:13,859
OK.

222
00:20:14,099 --> 00:20:15,419
Let me know if you need anything.

223
00:20:22,859 --> 00:20:23,859
Don't be like this.

224
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:32,920
My friend.

225
00:20:32,920 --> 00:20:33,920
I gotta go for a bit.

226
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,520
I'll get some dessert at the counter as well, then.

227
00:20:50,180 --> 00:20:51,180
Let's go.

228
00:20:56,839 --> 00:20:57,839
Bye-bye!

229
00:20:58,460 --> 00:20:59,140
Bye.

230
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:00,420
Bye.

231
00:21:04,059 --> 00:21:05,099
Here's your matcha cake.

232
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:06,220
Thank you.

233
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,099
(Next Episode)
You snuck out,

234
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,759
and came back hurt.

235
00:22:01,140 --> 00:22:02,240
Now you're telling me,

236
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:04,079
"That's my business"?

237
00:22:05,019 --> 00:22:06,619
You're just putting me up for now.

238
00:22:07,039 --> 00:22:08,099
Where I go,

239
00:22:08,099 --> 00:22:08,859
what I do,

240
00:22:08,940 --> 00:22:09,819
what I care about...

241
00:22:09,819 --> 00:22:10,859
None of it's your...

242
00:22:15,859 --> 00:22:16,859
Cheng Yu'an.

243
00:22:17,180 --> 00:22:18,180
So...

244
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:20,200
Which one's the real you?

245
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:21,900
Mom just woke up.

246
00:22:22,119 --> 00:22:23,239
She won't see outsiders yet.

247
00:22:25,920 --> 00:22:26,920
An outsider?

248
00:22:27,220 --> 00:22:28,619
I'll ask you one thing.

249
00:22:30,779 --> 00:22:31,819
Do you want me?

250
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,319
We're done.
